        <Literal xml:lang="en" datatypeIRI="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">Date may be used to express temporal information at any level of granularity.  Recommended best practice is to use an encoding scheme, such as the W3CDTF profile of ISO 8601 [W3CDTF].</Literal>
