        <Literal xml:lang="en" datatypeIRI="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">The described resource may be derived from the related resource in whole or in part. Recommended best practice is to identify the related resource by means of a string conforming to a formal identification system.</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
