        <Literal datatypeIRI="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">A mixture of the heaviest components of natural gas. Condensate is fluid at normal pressure and temperature.  Source: http://www.npd.no/en/About-us/Information-services/Dictionary/</Literal>
