        <Literal datatypeIRI="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">The downhole pressure opposite a formation of interest when the valves at the surface (or downhole) are completely closed. The pressure is transmitted by fluids which exist in a formation and are in communication with the wellbore. (column: wlbDstBottomHolePress)</Literal>
    </AnnotationAssertion>
    <AnnotationAssertion>
