        <Literal datatypeIRI="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">Current activity status of the discovery. Example of legal values: SHUT DOWN, PRODUCING, PDO APPROVED, DECIDED BY THE LICENSEES, PLANNING PHASE, DEV. LIKELY BUT NOT CLARIFIED, DEVELOPMENT NOT VERY LIKELY, NEW DISCOVERIES, INCLUDED IN OTHER DISCOVERY (column: dscCurrentActivityStatus)</Literal>
